Modular and retrofit cooling solutions
Modular cooling equipment can support phased capacity expansion and help operators deploy infrastructure more quickly. Retrofit-oriented solutions also offer opportunities to modernize existing data centers while avoiding the cost and disruption of complete facility replacement.

Intelligent thermal-management controls
Software-enabled monitoring and automated controls can help operators optimize temperature settings, manage cooling loads, and identify potential performance issues. Integrating thermal analytics with facility management platforms may improve operational visibility and support more efficient use of cooling resources.

